<title>UK: TENNIS-QUEEN'S GRASSCOURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QUEEN'S GRASSCOURT MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Queen's</p>
<p>grasscourt men's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round:16-Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Mark Woodforde</p>
<p>(Australia) 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Javier Frana (Argentina) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat 11-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) 6-0</p>
<p>3-6 6-3</p>
<p>9-Pat Rafter (Australia) beat Sebastien Laureau (Canada) 6-3</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Add second round</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Daniel Nestor (Canada) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Stephane Simian (France) beat Doug Flach (Canada) 6-7 (8-10)</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
<p>3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Leander Paes (India) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-1) 6-3</p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) beat 2-Michael Chang (U.S.) 6-3 2-6</p>
<p>7-6</p>
<p>(8-6)</p>
<p>Add second round</p>
<p>16-Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Kevin Ullyett (South Africa) 7- 5 4-6 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>7-Jim Courier (U.S.) vs. David Nainkin (South Africa) 6-3 rain stopped play</p>
<p>8-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) vs. Luis Herrera (Mexico) 7-5 6-5 rain stopped play</p>
</text>
